659
00:46:45,010 --> 00:46:49,600
So the number of
possible messages--

660
00:46:49,600 --> 00:46:58,400
So in a typical
message, what you

661
00:46:58,400 --> 00:47:15,955
expect Ni, which is Pi
N occurrences, of xi.

662
00:47:19,070 --> 00:47:24,840
So if you know for example, what
